{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112194","id":2962683571,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6wlvaz","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112194","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112194.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112194.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112194","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112194/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112194/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112194/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0bc0f9a7f0c291b287d96385f4676c35ca2a4791","number":112194,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve `TileMapLayer` terrain code","user":{"login":"IphStich","id":5625804,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjU4MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5625804?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich","html_url":"https://github.com/IphStich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR introduces several changes to the terrain related systems. None of these changes impact the behaviour, but they are a significant difference in implementation. Altogether, these changes should improve both performance and clarity. My hope is that this can be the springboard towards further improvements in this area of the engine.\r\n\r\nChanges introduced by this PR:\r\n\r\n**Replaced `TerrainConstraint` with `TerrainConstraints::Bit` and `TerrainConstraints::Action`. Also replaced `RBSet<TerrainConstraint>` with `TerrainConstraints` which functions as a wrapper around `RBMap<TerrainConstraints::Bit, TerrainConstraints::Action>`**\r\n\r\nThis doesn't change performance very much, however it does significantly improve code clarity. The previous behaviour using RBSet was to function practically as an RBMap. This is now explicit and clearer. As part of this restructuring, we no longer store a `Ref<TileSet>`, which should improve performance due to the many ref count operations involved.\r\n\r\n**DRY principles for obtaining cell patterns and for preparing to fill terrain**\r\n\r\nNot a lot to say to either of these changes. Just identified decently sized chunks of repeated code that could have been functions to reduce on repition while improving clarity.\r\n\r\n**Improved performance by reducing redundant operations**\r\n\r\nA couple functions were repeating operations, and some others were making frequent repeated calls to information that could have more easily been cached. These changes should improve performance, especially when performing very large terrain fill operations.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"mileston